  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Health in Bangladesh &#x2013; Multi-Donor Trust Funds (MDTF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this component is to support Government of Bangladesh&#x2019;s 4th Heath Sector Programme through providing financial assistance to the Multi-Donor Trust Funds, managed by World Bank. The component is supporting the Ministry of Health and Family Welfare in achieving universal health coverage through improving health services, with a focus on reducing inequality and improving systems and governance.</narrative>
  </description>
